{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ cause causes reason genetics anatomy))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#7_1744989077","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2527","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#7_1744989077\" , \"end_char\": 3978.000000 , \"headings\": \"Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020 Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020 What is canthus? Where is Medial Canthus? Where is Lateral Canthus? What are the different types of Canthal Tilts: What is Positive Canthal Tilt? Importance of <cover>Positive Canthal Tilt What is Negative Canthal Tilt? Cause </cover>of Negative Canthal Tilt What is Neutral Canthal Tilt? Can you change Canthal tilt? How to improve your Canthal Tilt? What are the different methods for Canthal Tilt Correction? What is Canthoplasty? Was this post helpful? \" , \"segment\": \"Can you change Canthal tilt? A canthoplasty is a technique used to change Canthal tilt. By canthoplasty your canthal tilt is fixed by making lateral canthus above the medical according to need normally about 2 mm above but varies with demand by the person. As a result the Lateral canthus becomes higher the medical canthus i.e positive canthal tilt. Rarely people looks for negative or neutral canthal tilt. Canthoplasty is a type "}}
