{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_59_603346943#9_1468447829","relevance":1,"reason":"The snippet is about surgical restoration/support of a positive canthal tilt and mentions natural appearance, but it does not explain why some people naturally have positive canthal tilt.","learned":"Canthoplasty can elevate/tighten the lateral canthus to restore or maintain a positive canthal tilt, but this result is surgery-focused."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ genetics genetic hereditary ethnicity anatomy orbital))","reason":"Broaden beyond the exact phrase 'positive canthal tilt' to find explanatory material on determinants of canthal tilt such as genetics, ethnicity, and orbital anatomy."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ genetics genetic hereditary ethnicity anatomy orbital))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1370231623#2_2504750992","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2529","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1370231623#2_2504750992\" , \"end_char\": 1801.000000 , \"headings\": \"Canthal Tilt in Cosmetic Plastic Surgery Canthal Tilt in Cosmetic Plastic Surgery Types of Canthal Tilt How to Improve your Canthal Tilt Canthal Tilt Correction Canthoplasty Positive Canthal Tilt Neutral Canthal Tilt \" , \"segment\": \"It is a concept that is conserved across gender lines and <cover>ethnicity. It is consistently found in youthful and attractive faces. Neutral canthal tilt </cover>is wheren there is no angle between the medial and lateral can thus. This appearance can be well tolerated in men and, often does not connoatate an aged appearance in men. With women, however, this is universally interpreted as a sign of aging. Neutral canthal til also contributes to the tired look that so many women dislke. Negative canthal tilt is most commonly an advanced sign of aging in both men and women. It is commonly associated with excess upper and lower eyelid skin. It is a strong driver of a tired or sorrowful appearance. How to Improve your Canthal Tilt So what causes canthal til "}}
