{"latest_judgment":{"docno":null,"relevance":0,"reason":"The previous exact-phrase query returned no results to judge.","learned":"The corpus does not appear to contain the exact phrase 'what causes canthal tilt'."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ natural born genetics inherited))","reason":"Search for direct evidence that positive canthal tilt is a natural/born trait influenced by inherited facial anatomy."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ natural born genetics inherited))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1370231623#7_2504756757","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2536","rank":2,"snippet":"Canthal Tilt Correction Canthoplasty Positive Canthal Tilt Neutral Canthal Tilt \" , \"segment\": \"A popular procedures is upper eyelid and lower eyelid blepharoplasty. During every preoperative cosmetic plastic surgery consultation, canthal tilt is carefully assessed. At Ocean Drive Plastic Surgery, we aim to correct canthal tilt to withn 5-9 degrees of positivity as this is a cornerstone of periorbital aesthetics. We augment every lower lid blepharoplasty with a procedure called a lateral retincular canthoplasty. This innovative procedure tightens and elevates the lateral canthus allowing us to accurately recreate the <cover>positive canthal tilt of your youth and providing for a natural </cover>look. Canthoplasty Our canthoplasty can be utilized on any type of lower eyelid procedure. We commonly complex it with lower eyelid spetal reset procedures in both men and women. As well it is always combined with transconjunctival lower eyelid approaches too. Recreation of positive canthal tilt is a required part of Dr. Durkin’s lower eyelid blepharoplasty procedures. In patients who have preexisting positive tilt, Dr. Durkin supports the existing tilt with a support canthoplasty.\" , \"start_char\": 2495.000000 , \"title\": \"Canthal Tilt | Cosmetic ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_59_603346943#9_1468447829","rank":1,"relevance":1}]}}
