{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1184422327#4_2642745179","relevance":1,"reason":"The result is broadly about eye attractiveness and orbital/eyelid structure, with canthal tilt only appearing as a subtopic heading. The visible passage does not explain why some people have positive canthal tilt.","learned":"Some attractiveness-oriented pages discuss eyelid/orbit structure, but this result did not provide direct evidence about causes of positive canthal tilt."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ lateral canthus) (+ medial canthus) (+ higher above elevated))","reason":"Search for focused documents defining positive canthal tilt anatomically as the lateral canthus being higher than the medial canthus, which directly supports the reason some people have it."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ lateral canthus) (+ medial canthus) (+ higher above elevated))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#2_1744980928","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2539","rank":1,"snippet":"helpful? \" , \"segment\": \"Also Read: How to tell Low Cheekbones or High Cheekbones What are the different types of Canthal Tilts: There are three types of tilts i.e Positive Canthal Tilt Negative Canthal Tilt Neutral Canthal Tilt What is Positive Canthal Tilt? A Positive Canthal Tilt can be said whenever there is an angle between medial and lateral canthus is five to eight degrees. It can easily be measured by drawing an imaginary line between the mid pupil portion of the eye. Importance of <cover>Positive Canthal Tilt The Canthus on the ear side i.e lateral canthus should be 5 to 8 degrees higher </cover>than that of medial i.e canthus towards the nose. Because beautician believes it is a factor of beauty. So Positive canthal tilt eyes are called as Hunter Eyes. It has been widely measured and discussed in the fashion industry. It has a role in fashion industries as well as gender and ethnicity.\" , \"start_char\": 1128.000000 , \"title\": \"Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020\" , \"url\": \"https://communitypharmacies.co.uk/"}}
