{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#2_1744980928","relevance":2,"reason":"The page is dedicated to canthal tilt and directly defines positive canthal tilt as the lateral canthus being 5–8 degrees higher than the medial canthus, with mentions of gender and ethnicity. It still does not clearly answer why some people have it beyond anatomical definition and broad variation.","learned":"Positive canthal tilt occurs when the lateral/outer canthus is higher than the medial/inner canthus, often described as a 5–8 degree upward angle."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ sex gender women men ethnic ethnicity aging youthful))","reason":"Search for documents that connect positive canthal tilt to demographic and age-related variation, which is closer to explaining why some people naturally have it."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ sex gender women men ethnic ethnicity aging youthful))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1397690825#6_3080890346","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2540","rank":1,"snippet":" , \"headings\": \"How to Get Attractive Eyes for Guys How to Get Attractive Eyes for Guys Orbital Height/Width Upper Eyelid Exposure Canthal Tilt Downturned Medial Canthus Arch Shape Eyebrows Scleral Show Color Limbal Ring Overall Dimensions Unattractive Male Eyes Attractive Male Eyes How To Get Nice Eyes Mewing Blepharoplasty (Eyelid Lift) Canthoplasty & Canthopexy Eyebrows \" , \"segment\": \"But if your lateral canthus is lower than your medial canthus, you have negative canthal tilt. The normal male Caucasian medial canthus is about 2 mm lower than the lateral canthus (<cover>positive canthal tilt). Women </cover>have an even more positive canthal tilt, and their medial canthus is 4 mm lower than the lateral canthus. A positive canthal tilt is also known as a Mongoloid feature. Indeed, far eastern ethnic groups have a more positive tilt. Generally, a slightly positive canthal tilt is most attractive. A negative canthal tilt is unattractive and makes you look tired. A canthal tilt that’s too positive makes you look like an alien. Before you conclude that you have a negative canthal tilt, keep in mind that taking a selfie from below eye level will make your canthal "}}
