{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1397690825#6_3080890346","relevance":2,"reason":"This page gives direct partial evidence that positive canthal tilt is a normal anatomical arrangement and varies by sex and ethnicity, but it is an attractiveness/how-to page rather than a dedicated explanation of why some people naturally have positive canthal tilt.","learned":"Some sources report normal positive canthal tilt in Caucasian men, greater positive tilt in women, and more positive tilt in Far Eastern ethnic groups."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ why causes caused due) (+ genetics anatomy ethnicity aging))","reason":"Try a focused direct-causation query using 'why/causes/due' to find a page dedicated to explaining why positive canthal tilt occurs naturally."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ why causes caused due) (+ genetics anatomy ethnicity aging))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1370231623#4_2504753484","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2541","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1370231623#4_2504753484\" , \"end_char\": 2382.000000 , \"headings\": \"Canthal Tilt in Cosmetic Plastic Surgery Canthal Tilt in Cosmetic Plastic Surgery Types of Canthal Tilt How to Improve your Canthal Tilt Canthal Tilt Correction Canthoplasty<cover>Positive Canthal Tilt Neutral Canthal Tilt \" , \"segment\": \"Like aging itself, diminishing canthal tilt is multifactorial. But, there are a number of things that you can do to maintain your overall periorbatl appearance. Canthal Tilt Correction 1. Do not smoke. Smoking causes </cover>reduced elasticity in every tissue of your body including your lower eyelids. Loss of elasticity leads to laxity in the skin and the supporting structures of your eyelid. To help maintain canthal tilt and periorbital til, avoid smoking. 2. Use Sunscreen. Sun damage is another leading cause of elasticity loss in the soft tissue Always wear appropriate sunscreen.\" , \"start_char\": 1802.000000 , \"title\": \"Canthal Tilt | Cosmetic Surgery | Fort Lauderdale to Vero Beach, FL.\" , \"url\": \"https://www.oceandriveplasticsurgery.com/"}}
