{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#4_1744984227","relevance":2,"reason":"The page is dedicated to canthal tilt and gives partial causal evidence: positive tilt is associated with young people, while negative tilt is associated with aging and excessive upper/lower eyelid skin. It indirectly explains that people may have positive tilt when youthful eyelid support has not drooped, but it is not a full direct explanation of why some naturally have it.","learned":"Positive canthal tilt is associated with youth; negative canthal tilt is associated with aging and excess eyelid skin causing a drooped/tired appearance."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ genetics ethnicity anatomy aging) (+ \"lateral canthus\" \"orbital rim\" \"lateral canthal tendon\"))","reason":"Search for documents combining canthal tilt with specific anatomical structures and demographic causes, likely to explain why the lateral canthus sits higher in some people."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ genetics ethnicity anatomy aging) (+ \"lateral canthus\" \"orbital rim\" \"lateral canthal tendon\"))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_54_1467174243#3_3111259662","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2553","rank":1,"snippet":"Correction? Brow Lift Eyelid Lift Contact Us Today \" , \"segment\": \"It is an integral concept in periorbital aesthetics and forms the foundation of several eyelid procedures. According to the experts, a canthal tilt of about five to eight degrees is considered to be the ideal for achieving a bright and youthful feminine look. Canthal tilts may be desired as positive, neutral, and negative. A positive canthal tilt occurs when the medial canthus is located at an angle of five to eight degrees below the <cover>lateral canthus. The reverse is called a negative canthal tilt and is often considered to be an advanced indicator of aging. </cover>Negative canthal tilt can make you look extremely old, tired, and sad. A neutral canthal tilt occurs when both the medial and the lateral canthus are located along the same line and do not have any angle between them. What Are the Procedures Used for Canthal Tilt Correction? Two of the most popular eye-feminisation surgeries that are widely employed for the correction of canthal tilt include the brow lift and the eyelid lift. Brow Lift Often known as a forehead lift, a brow lift is essentially a cosmetic procedure "}}
{"request":{"judgments":"21/50"}}
{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_54_1467174243#3_3111259662","relevance":2,"reason":"This cosmetic surgery page gives direct anatomical support: positive canthal tilt occurs when the medial canthus is 5–8 degrees below the lateral canthus, and negative tilt is associated with aging. It is not a dedicated explanation of why some people naturally have positive canthal tilt beyond anatomy/youthfulness.","learned":"Positive canthal tilt is caused anatomically by the lateral canthus sitting above the medial canthus; loss/reversal of this tilt is often framed as age-related drooping."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q2553","reason":"The current query combines canthal tilt with anatomy, aging, ethnicity, and lateral canthal tendon/orbital-rim terms, so additional results may provide a more direct cause/determinant explanation."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2553"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#5_1744985815","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2553","rank":3,"snippet":"are the different methods for Canthal Tilt Correction? What is Canthoplasty? Was this post helpful? \" , \"segment\": \"So Negative Canthal tilt Lookism has less value in the field of beauty and fashion. Cause of Negative Canthal Tilt It can be explained as excessive upper and lower skin of the eyelid causes negative canthal tilt. It is sometimes considered as the appearance of a strongly tried or sorrowful face. What is Neutral Canthal Tilt? The Neutral <cover>Canthal Tilt means there is no angle between Medial and Lateral canthus. Simple if there is no angle means it’s nothing or neutral. This appearance in men has not such importance as it can be found at any aging. </cover>Because often it can be found in young men. But for women, it is considered as a sign of aging especially in the field of fashion industries. The Neutral Canthal Tilt looks as if she is tried in women so most of the women dislike this look.\" , \"start_char\": 2338.000000 , \"title\": \"Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020\" , \"url\": \"","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_59_603346943#3_1468437512","rank":2,"relevance":2}]}}
