{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_144139279#16_267298312","relevance":2,"reason":"This clinical/NCBI-style result is not dedicated to positive canthal tilt, but it gives direct supporting evidence that upslanted palpebral fissure is defined by palpebral fissure inclination being greater than typical for age, implying normal age-based variation and a measurable anatomical basis.","learned":"Upslanted palpebral fissures are clinically defined as palpebral fissure inclination more than two standard deviations above the age mean, so upward/positive tilt reflects measurable anatomical variation relative to age norms."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ \"what causes\" causes determinants factors) (+ aging genetics ethnicity anatomy))","reason":"Search for a document explicitly explaining causes or determinants of canthal tilt using cause/factor language, aiming for a grade-3 result dedicated to the information need."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ \"what causes\" causes determinants factors) (+ aging genetics ethnicity anatomy))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1370231623#3_2504752287","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2555","rank":1,"snippet":": \"Canthal Tilt in Cosmetic Plastic Surgery Canthal Tilt in Cosmetic Plastic Surgery Types of Canthal Tilt How to Improve your Canthal Tilt Canthal Tilt Correction Canthoplasty Positive Canthal Tilt Neutral Canthal Tilt \" , \"segment\": \"Neutral canthal til also contributes to the tired look that so many women dislke. Negative canthal tilt is most commonly an advanced sign of aging in both men and women. It is commonly associated with excess upper and lower eyelid skin. It is a strong driver of a tired or sorrowful appearance. How to Improve your <cover>Canthal Tilt So what causes canthal til to change over time? Like aging </cover>itself, diminishing canthal tilt is multifactorial. But, there are a number of things that you can do to maintain your overall periorbatl appearance. Canthal Tilt Correction 1. Do not smoke. Smoking causes reduced elasticity in every tissue of your body including your lower eyelids.\" , \"start_char\": 1426.000000 , \"title\": \"Canthal Tilt | Cosmetic Surgery | Fort Lauderdale to Vero Beach, FL.\" , \"url\": \"https://www.oceandriveplasticsurgery.com/canthal-tilt-in-cosmetic-plastic-surgery/\" }"}}
