{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_53_914516390#0_2031867757","relevance":2,"reason":"The result is about almond eye surgery rather than directly explaining positive canthal tilt. It provides partial evidence that almond/upturned eye shape can be naturally inherited, that ethnic variation exists, and that canthal tilt/lower eyelid position may be inherited, but the specific example is inherited negative canthal tilt rather than positive.","learned":"Canthal tilt and related almond-eye shape can be inherited and influenced by eyelid position/anatomy; ethnic variation in eye shape is acknowledged."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ inherited genetic hereditary ethnic) (+ positive negative natural))","reason":"Search directly for documents stating that canthal tilt, including positive versus negative tilt, is inherited/genetic or varies naturally by ethnicity."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ inherited genetic hereditary ethnic) (+ positive negative natural))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_53_914516390#1_2031869761","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2558","rank":4,"snippet":"surgery? Before & After Photos Contact the LA Oculoplastic Experts \" , \"segment\": \"Although, that is not to say, non-almond eyes cannot be beautiful. There are a variety of other factors that make eyes beautiful and ethnic variations exist. Surgical improvement may be possible for patients in Beverly Hills who have rounded outer canthus and/or lower eyelids that are rounded and rest too low with sclera show (either inherited or as result of prior surgery “post-blepharoplasty eyelid malposition”). 24 year old male, complained of looking sad and tired due to <cover>inherited lower eyelid retraction with negative canthal tilt </cover>and droopy upper eyelids (ptosis). He underwent almond eye surgery (lower eyelid retraction surgery using scar-less transconjunctival technique and canthoplasty) and upper eyelid ptosis repair. Before and 3 months after eye plastic surgery photos are shown. Young male with congenital rounded eyes and lower eyelid retraction with scleral show who underwent lower eyelid retraction surgery with internal Alloderm graft and canthoplasty, resulting in elevation of the lower eyelids and creating more of an almond eye shape. He also had tear trough silicone implants placed. How to achieve Almond Eye Surgery? Video showing Dr. Taban on ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1397690825#6_3080890346","rank":1,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1397690825#5_3080888894","rank":2,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_53_914516390#0_2031867757","rank":3,"relevance":2}]}}
