{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_53_914516390#1_2031869761","relevance":2,"reason":"This is another segment from an almond-eye surgery page. It supports that eye shape, lower eyelid position, and canthal tilt-related features can be inherited or congenital and vary by ethnicity, but the highlighted example is inherited negative canthal tilt and the page is not dedicated to explaining positive canthal tilt specifically.","learned":"Canthal tilt-related eyelid positions may be inherited or congenital; ethnic variation in eye shape exists, and surgery can alter the lateral canthus/lower eyelid position."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"why\" \"positive canthal tilt\")","reason":"Try the direct natural-language question with the correct spelling; a dedicated Q&A or explainer may contain the exact answer."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"why\" \"positive canthal tilt\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#8_1744990761","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2559","rank":2,"snippet":" , \"headings\": \"Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020 Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020 What is canthus? Where is Medial Canthus? Where is Lateral Canthus? What are the different types of Canthal Tilts: What is Positive Canthal Tilt? Importance of <cover>Positive Canthal Tilt What is Negative Canthal Tilt? Cause of Negative Canthal Tilt What is Neutral Canthal Tilt? Can you change Canthal tilt? How to improve your Canthal Tilt? What are the different methods for Canthal Tilt Correction? What is Canthoplasty? Was this post helpful? \" , \"segment\": \"Canthoplasty is a type of optic surgery in which surgeon opens the eyelids and tighten and harden muscle tendons. How to improve your Canthal Tilt? If we want to improve canthal tilt we must know the cause of the canthal tilt changing i.e why </cover>the canthal tilt changes over a time period? There are many causes why canthal Tilt changes like aging are one of the most common causes. One must take a lot of effort to improve the canthal tilt. What are the different methods for Canthal Tilt Correction? There are a number of ways ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#7_1744989077","rank":1,"relevance":2}]}}
