{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#8_1744990761","relevance":2,"reason":"This is another segment from a canthal-tilt guide. It says canthal tilt changes over time and aging is a common cause, and it mentions canthoplasty tightening muscle tendons, but it still focuses on changing/negative tilt rather than directly explaining why some people naturally have positive canthal tilt.","learned":"Canthal tilt can change over time; aging is repeatedly identified as a common reason for loss of positive tilt, and tendon tightening/elevation can surgically increase it."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"upslanted palpebral fissures\" (+ definition causes associated genetic normal age))","reason":"Search the clinical term for positive/upward eye slant with definition and cause terms; clinical documents may directly explain congenital, age-norm, or genetic reasons for upward fissure slant."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"upslanted palpebral fissures\" (+ definition causes associated genetic normal age))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_06_249110588#0_446322288","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2560","rank":1,"snippet":"palpebral fissure inclination is more than two standard deviations above the mean for age (objective); or, the inclination of the palpebral fissure is greater than typical for age. ... 1,2 ... More on Upslanted palpebral fissure » Causes List: Upslanted palpebral fissure Some of the causes of the condition may include: 3 Causes of Upslanted Palpebral Fissure: 10q22.3q23.3 Microdeletion Syndrome 10q22.3q23.3 Microduplication Syndrome 16q24.3 Microdeletion Syndrome 1p21.3 Microdeletion Syndrome 1q41q42 Microdeletion Syndrome 1q44 Microdeletion Syndrome 20q13.33 Microdeletion Syndrome 22q11.2 Deletion Syndrome 2q37 Microdeletion Syndrome ... ... More Causes of Upslanted palpebral fissure » Causes List for Upslanted palpebral fissure Some possible causes of Upslanted palpebral fissure or similar disorders may include: 4 AREDYLD (Upslanted palpebral fissure) Acrocephalopolydactylous dysplasia (Upslanted palpebral fissure) Acromicric dysplasia (Upslanted palpebral fissure) Alagille syndrome type 1 (Upslanted palpebral fissure) Alagille syndrome (Upslanted palpebral ... ... Full <cover>Causes List for Upslanted palpebral fissure » Names and Terminology Synonyms: Mongoloid slant ; UPSLANTED PALPEBRAL FISSURES ;</cover>\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"Upslanted palpebral fissure - Symptoms, Causes, Diagnosis, Treatments - Disease Information\" , \"url\": \"http://www.familydiagnosis.com/diseases/upslanted-palpebral-fissure.html\" }"}}
