{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_06_249110588#0_446322288","relevance":3,"reason":"This document is dedicated to upslanted palpebral fissure, a clinical equivalent of upward/positive eye-corner tilt, and directly provides a definition plus causes. It states that the inclination is greater than typical for age and lists many genetic/chromosomal syndromes and microdeletions/microduplications as causes, directly supporting why some people may have a positive/upslanted tilt.","learned":"Upslanted/positive eye tilt can be a measurable age-relative anatomical feature and may be caused by genetic or chromosomal syndromes such as microdeletions, microduplications, Alagille syndrome, and related disorders."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q2560","reason":"This query produced a highly relevant causes-focused clinical result for the upslanted-palpebral-fissure equivalent of positive canthal tilt; additional results are likely to contain more direct cause evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2560"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_06_249110588#1_446324151","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2560","rank":2,"snippet":"palpebral fissure Causes List for Upslanted palpebral fissure Names and Terminology \" , \"segment\": \"3 Causes of Upslanted Palpebral Fissure: 10q22.3q23.3 Microdeletion Syndrome 10q22.3q23.3 Microduplication Syndrome 16q24.3 Microdeletion Syndrome 1p21.3 Microdeletion Syndrome 1q41q42 Microdeletion Syndrome 1q44 Microdeletion Syndrome 20q13.33 Microdeletion Syndrome 22q11.2 Deletion Syndrome 2q37 Microdeletion Syndrome ... ... More Causes of Upslanted palpebral fissure » Causes List for Upslanted palpebral fissure Some possible causes of Upslanted palpebral fissure or similar disorders may include: 4 AREDYLD (Upslanted palpebral fissure) Acrocephalopolydactylous dysplasia (Upslanted palpebral fissure) Acromicric dysplasia (Upslanted palpebral fissure) Alagille syndrome type 1 (Upslanted palpebral fissure) Alagille syndrome (Upslanted palpebral ... ... Full <cover>Causes List for Upslanted palpebral fissure » Names and Terminology Synonyms: Mongoloid slant ; UPSLANTED PALPEBRAL FISSURES ; </cover>Upslanting palpebral fissures ; Upward slanted palpebral fissures ; Upward slanting of palpebral fissures ; Upward slanting palpebral fissures ... Source: GTR (NCBI ... 5 ... More General Information on Upslanted palpebral fissure » • • • References [from HPO] Source:\" , \"start_char\": 454.000000 , \"title\": \"Upslanted palpebral fissure - Symptoms, Causes, Diagnosis, Treatments - Disease Information\" , \"url\": \"http://www.familydiagnosis.com/diseases/upslanted-palpebral-fissure.html\" }"}}
