{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"upturned eyes\" (+ genetics inherited natural anatomy))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1435497587#12_3170318260","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2574","rank":1,"snippet":"10. The Eyes Have It Up Next: \" , \"segment\": \"Reach for waterproof eyeliner and create a color block look on your entire eye or only at the outer corner, but always end it with wing shape. A pop of color is another technique to highlight your features. Green-colored eyeliners are best for brown eyes, deep reds for blue eyes, while brown-eyed babes can choose from the rainbow. 10. The Eyes Have It View this post on Instagram A post shared by badgalriri (@badgalriri) Keep your face makeup nude or <cover>natural – the best makeup look for upturned eyes </cover>accentuate the eyes alone. A bold lip or saturated cheek color will draw away attention from your eyes. Choose natural shades for your cheek and lip color. If you were going for a sultry, glamorous eye look, top off your lips with a high shine gloss. If you were inspired by T. Swifty’s iconic red lip, swipe on eyeliner and a few coats of mascara to have you looking 22. Check out this video by Sephora to find out your eye shape:\" , \"start_char\": 6022.000000 , \""}}
